Failure Handling

The pipeline should prevent unsafe deployments.

Examples:

Build Failure
Build Failed
     ↓
Pipeline Stopped
     ↓
No Deployment
Security Failure
Critical Vulnerability
        ↓
Security Gate Failed
        ↓
Pipeline Stopped
        ↓
No Image Promotion
Deployment Failure
Deployment Failure
       ↓
Health Check
       ↓
Rollback / Previous Version

